contentText:
Jimmy Fallon and Justin Timberlake are ready for Turkey Day. In a sneak peek from the upcoming Thanksgiving episode of The Tonight Show , the duo team up for a festive medley of classic hits that&#8217;ll get you into celebration mode ahead of the holiday.

